---
description: Product context and project priorities
alwaysApply: true
---

This project is a web app for social media automation, content creation, publishing, analytics, and digital marketing workflows.

The repository already has working code and structure. Preserve existing architecture unless there is a strong reason to change it.

Product priorities:
- reliability over cleverness
- minimal safe diffs
- incremental improvements over large rewrites
- safe and traceable automations
- explicit analytics definitions
- isolation of provider-specific logic
- maintainable code that supports future scaling

When making changes:
- first understand the current repo patterns
- prefer improving the current structure instead of replacing it
- prefer editing existing files over introducing many new abstractions
- avoid unnecessary file moves, renames, or full rewrites
- propose larger refactors before implementing them
- preserve backward compatibility unless explicitly asked otherwise